          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Insight 2 - What Happened with other &quot;Oil&quot; Money?
</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='10'> Annual Rev as  % of Each Countries Peak Year: 1968 - 2025</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>This chart shows the annual revenue as a % of the opeak revenue for each country, This was to show how long the windfall lasted and how consistent or volatile was it. NOR  / NL are inflation adjusted. UK  / IRL are not inflation adjusted. So Peak years are understated for UK in 1980s.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
