    <worksheet name='Insight 2A - Cummulative Amounts Received '>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Insight 2 - How does Irelands &quot;Oil&quot; Money Compare?
</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='10'>Cummulative Revenue since windfalls started</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>IRL: excess CT i.e. CT above the 2000 - 2014 norm. is from 2015. NOR: petroleum tax, 2027 proces. NL: Total gas revenue, 2021 prices, to 2021. UK: oil and gas not inflation adjusted. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
