            <zone h='98400' id='35' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99000' x='500' y='800'>
              <zone h='98400' id='33' type-v2='layout-basic' w='99000' x='500' y='800'>
                <zone h='90300' id='16' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='73063' x='500' y='8900'>
                  <zone h='90300' id='14' type-v2='layout-basic' w='73063' x='500' y='8900'>
                    <zone h='90300' id='7' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='32047' x='500' y='8900'>
                      <zone h='90300' id='5' type-v2='layout-basic' w='32047' x='500' y='8900'>
                        <zone h='79100' id='3' name='Insight 1 - Has irleland Struck &quot;Oil&quot;?' w='32047' x='500' y='8900'>
                          <zone-style>
                            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                          </zone-style>
                        </zone>
                        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11200' id='28' type-v2='text' w='32047' x='500' y='88000'>
                          <formatted-text>
                            <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Insight 1 - In 2025 Ireland received CT (€32.9bn) almost equivalent to Norways &quot;Oil&quot; tax received (€33.8bn). It was 6 time sgreater than UK North Sea Oil fo the same period, and also double NL best &quot;gas&quot; revenue year (€15.4bn  in 2013). Ireland also exceeded Norway&apos;s tax take in 2016, 2017, 2020 an 2021. In conclusion, yes, Ireland&apos;s Corporation tax is on par with tax take from other countries &quot;Oil&quot; strikes, and we can say tha ireland has stuck &quot;Oil&quot;.</run>
                          </formatted-text>
                          <zone-style>
                            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                          </zone-style>
                        </zone>
                      </zone>
                    </zone>
                    <zone h='45148' id='10' name='Insight 2 -What Happened in other countries' w='41016' x='32547' y='8900'>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone h='37152' id='12' name='Insight 2A - Cummulative Amounts Received ' w='41016' x='32547' y='54048'>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8000' id='29' type-v2='text' w='41016' x='32547' y='91200'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000'>Insight 2 - &quot;Oil&quot; money rises quickly then fades slowly over time. It is also volatile revenue stream, with the UK and NL revenue largely gone or declining. Ireland has earned more in 11 years of its CT excess than the UK, NL or even the Norwegians did  over the same timeframe of their &quot;Oil&quot; discoveries.</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
                <zone h='72000' id='18' name='Insight 3 - What is Ireland doing with its Winfall?' w='25937' x='73563' y='8900'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='18300' id='30' type-v2='text' w='25937' x='73563' y='80900'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Insight 3 - Surprisingly is saving more than it appears. Net Debt iis down €52bn since 2021 with FIF &amp; ICNF funds forecast to reach €60bn by 2030. However, only €17bn of the €81 bn total received so far in Excess CT, has been ringfenced. FIF (€49bn by 2030) is more like Nor model, invests for future spending needs. ICNF (€10bn by 2030) is more like NL model, for designated projects and infrstructure. The remainder  has been used for mixture of approaches by building cash and cutting net debt quite significantly, as well as more like UK model using for current spennding.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='34' h='3999' id='17' is-fixed='true' type-v2='title' w='99000' x='500' y='800'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='4101' id='38' name='Insight 1 - Has irleland Struck &quot;Oil&quot;?' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.1p74xg80thz54r1bquqiy08jgllp].[none:Calculation_2141910121365525:nk]' type-v2='color' w='99000' x='500' y='4799'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
